<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1024] cluster_reuters.sh still relies on old (now removed) lda implementation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1024</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproduce by running cluster_reuters.sh in examples.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seems like the example relies on lda and lda_topics in the mahout driver. The script needs to be changed to rely on the new implementation only.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12559101">MAHOUT-1024</key>
