                            <comment id="13288254" author="isabel" created="Sun, 3 Jun 2012 20:37:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Removing LDA from the driver caused this example to fail.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13288264" author="isabel" created="Sun, 3 Jun 2012 21:25:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch to remove the example related to the old lda implementation altogether. Committing as soon as I see all tests passing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13289147" author="ssc" created="Tue, 5 Jun 2012 04:31:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Removed the example for the old LDA, fixed the remaining examples, they were broken due to a refactoring in ClusterDumper&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13289184" author="hudson" created="Tue, 5 Jun 2012 06:04:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1529 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1529/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1529/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
